<title>SINGAPORE: Asian producer sells Oct Tapis at $1.00 premium.</title>
<headline>Asian producer sells Oct Tapis at $1.00 premium.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>A producer has sold mid October Tapis crude at a premium of $1.00 above published quotes, an industry source said on Monday.</p>
<p>The 300,000 barrel cargo was sold to a Singapore refiner, the source said.</p>
<p>The previous Tapis deal in the market was at quotes +95 cents when the same producer sold 300-350,000 barrels of October Tapis about two weeks ago to a Japanese refiner.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65 870 3081)</p>
</text>
